---
name: open_application
alias: 启灵术
brief: "Launch applications: notepad, calculator, browser, etc."
description: "启动指定的应用程序，可选择直接打开网址"
keywords:
  - 打开
  - 启动
  - 应用
  - 程序
  - open
  - launch
  - app
  - application
when_to_use: "When user wants to open or launch an application"
parameters:
  - name: name
    type: string
    description: "notepad/calculator/explorer/chrome/edge/firefox/vscode/word/excel/powerpoint/terminal/powershell/help"
    required: true
  - name: path
    type: string
    description: "自定义路径"
    required: false
  - name: arguments
    type: string
    description: "启动参数"
    required: false
executor: builtin:open_application
---
